WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.469 --> 00:00:07.609
A duel can only take place amongst two people,
if there are three people involved it is actually

00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:09.810
called a truel.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:19.570
In 1990 a police department in Michigan staged
an entire fake weddings with undercover cops

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.599
acting as the bride and groom.

00:00:21.599 --> 00:00:27.080
They invited numerous local drug dealers to
the wedding and busted them all at the reception.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:32.239
In 2006, an Australian man tried to sell New
Zealand on eBay.

00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:38.770
The starting price was $0.01 Australian dollars,
but it managed to reach $3,000 before eBay

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.420
closed the auction.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:46.030
Three brave soviet engineers volunteered their
lives at Chernobyl to release water from the

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:47.030
broken reactor.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:51.970
Had they not done this the nuclear fallout
would have covered most of Europe.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.510
All three men died shortly afterwards.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:59.300
The last time someone died from a spider bite
in Australia was in 1981.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:03.720
Banana ketchup is popular in the Philippines.

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:08.870
When the Earth first formed a day lasted for
only 5.5 hours.

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.320
At 6,000 degrees celsius, the Earth's core
is just as hot as the surface of the Sun.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.510
If you travelled at the same speed that the
Earth travels through space, you could reach

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.159
the moon in 3.5 hours.

00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:26.550
A space suit costs $12 million.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.870
When you eat pineapple, it is actually eating
you back.

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:34.780
It contains an enzyme called Bromelain that
digests proteins.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.620
That's why your tongue tingles whilst you
eat it.

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:43.400
25% of Spongebob Squarepants viewers are adults
with no children.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.110
The world's largest tyre manufacturer is LEGO.

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:52.440
The toy company produces 318 million LEGO
tyres per year.

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:57.170
A study in Sweden revealed that women with
breast implants are three times more likely

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.350
to commit suicide than the average woman.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:05.991
The air quality of Mumbai is so bad that breathing
it is the equivalent of smoking two and a

00:02:05.991 --> 00:02:08.600
half packs of cigarettes a day.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:14.390
In the 16th century women often wore a black
face mask whilst outside called a visard.

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:17.250
It was meant to protect the woman's face from
sunburn.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:22.550
The mask was held on by the a small bead inside
the mask which the woman would bite down on

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:24.180
to hold the mask in place.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:37.060
Thus making her faceless and mute.

